 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Gross margin of 52.8% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1778129/000119312526210366/0001193125-26-210366-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210366"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $38.2m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1778129/000119312526210366/0001193125-26-210366-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210366"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 1.9% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1778129/000119312526210366/0001193125-26-210366-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210366"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 53.9% to 52.8% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1778129/000119312526210366/0001193125-26-210366-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210366"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 5.3% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1778129/000119312526210366/0001193125-26-210366-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210366"},{"text":"Debt of $229.7m against equity of $90.9m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1778129/000119312526210366/0001193125-26-210366-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-210366"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 7.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (546,174 shares across 14